@startuml
title A washing machine
concise "Program" as P
concise "Water" as W
binary "Door lock" as L
analog "Drum speed" between 0 and 1400 as D
@0
P is Idle
W is Empty
L is low
D is 0
@5
P is Wash
W is Filling
L is high
@15
W is Full
D is 50
@40
P is Rinse
D is 400
@55
P is Spin
W is Empty
D is 1400
@70
P is Idle
D is 0
L is low
@enduml
